{"id":"cartridges-anatomy","rev":1,"lang":"cs","status":"published","review_flag":null,"disclaimer":null,"title":"Stavba náboje","summary":"Hull (nábojnice), primer (zápalka), powder (prach), wad (kontejner), broky a zálisek: co je uvnitř sportovního cartridge (náboje), jak každá část ovlivňuje výstřel a které náboje zakazují pravidla Sporting™ a Compak® Sporting.","body":[{"k":"gear-cartridges-p1","t":"p","html":"<a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/cs/glossary/cartridge/\"><span lang=\"en\">Cartridge</span> (náboj)</a> obsahuje vše pro jeden výstřel: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/cs/glossary/hull/\"><span lang=\"en\">hull</span> (nábojnici)</a> s kovovým dnem, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/cs/glossary/primer/\"><span lang=\"en\">primer</span> (zápalku)</a>, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/cs/glossary/powder/\"><span lang=\"en\">powder</span> (prach)</a>, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/cs/glossary/wad/\"><span lang=\"en\">wad</span> (kontejner)</a> a broky. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/cs/glossary/empties/\"><span lang=\"en\">Empty cases</span> (prázdné nábojnice)</a> jsou vystřelené nábojnice.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null,"anchor":"gear-cartridges"},{"k":"dg-cartridge-cutaway","t":"diagram","html":"<figure class=\"dg\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\"><p class=\"dg-h\" id=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\">Náboj v podélném řezu</p><svg class=\"dg-svg\" viewBox=\"40 70 520 250\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\" focusable=\"false\"><rect class=\"dg-c1\" x=\"96\" y=\"96\" width=\"440\" height=\"138\" rx=\"3\"/><rect class=\"dg-cut\" x=\"104\" y=\"104\" width=\"424\" height=\"122\"/>\n<path class=\"dg-c2\" d=\"M58 86h20v6h80v146h-80v6h-20z\"/><rect class=\"dg-c3\" x=\"58\" y=\"148\" width=\"26\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\"/>\n<rect class=\"dg-c4\" x=\"158\" y=\"104\" width=\"54\" height=\"122\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/>\n<rect class=\"dg-c5\" x=\"212\" y=\"104\" width=\"16\" height=\"122\"/><path class=\"dg-c5l\" d=\"M228 112 l11 106 l11 -106 l11 106 l11 -106M272 106h194M272 224h194M272 106v118\"/>\n<circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"282\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"293.8\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"305.6\" c